{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>You</b> — it is possible that it is a mem of [from] תשמרם, regarding the words of HaShem." "<b>You will guard us</b> — with a dagesh in the bet [of בהם?], and this is like אלה [these], and its meaning: for the children of his generation are evil, therefore after him סביב. And the sense: that they roam about in every place to do evil."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:11.732656626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}